# KSI-CMT-VTD / KSI-MLA-EVC / KSI-PIY-GIV: AWS Config Rule Compliance
# Validates all seven AWS Config rules are ACTIVE and COMPLIANT:
# - ebs-encrypted: EBS volumes encrypted (KSI-SVC-VRI)
# - s3-no-public-access: S3 blocks public access (KSI-CNA-RNT)
# - cloudtrail-enabled: CloudTrail is enabled (KSI-MLA-LET)
# - root-mfa-enabled: Root account has MFA (KSI-IAM-MFA)
# - secrets-rotation: Secrets have rotation enabled (KSI-SVC-ASM)
# - guardduty-enabled: GuardDuty is enabled (KSI-MLA-OSM)
# - vpc-flow-logs: VPC flow logs are enabled (KSI-MLA-LET)

META
    esp_id `ksi-cmt-vtd-mla-evc-config-rules-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `aws`
    criticality `high`

    title `KSI-CMT-VTD / KSI-MLA-EVC / KSI-PIY-GIV: AWS Config Rule Compliance`
    description `Validates all seven AWS Config managed rules are ACTIVE and COMPLIANT, confirming continuous automated evaluation of key security controls`
    author `example-security`
    tags `aws,config,compliance,fedramp,KSI-CMT-VTD,KSI-MLA-EVC,KSI-PIY-GIV`

    control_mapping `KSI:KSI-CMT-VTD,KSI:KSI-MLA-EVC,KSI:KSI-PIY-GIV`
    control_objective `KSI-CMT-VTD,KSI-MLA-EVC,KSI-PIY-GIV`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `AWS:us-east-1:logging-infrastructure`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `3`
    recommendation `Ensure all Config rules are in ACTIVE state and COMPLIANT. NON_COMPLIANT results require remediation of the underlying resources.`

    component_id `comp-aws-logging`

    impl_KSI_CMT_VTD `Validation throughout deployment is confirmed by verifying that AWS managed Config rules continuously evaluate key security controls across the resource inventory. Each rule is validated to be in ACTIVE state and returning a COMPLIANT result, confirming that the security controls being monitored are correctly configured across all in-scope resources.`

    impl_KSI_MLA_EVC `Configuration evaluation is validated by confirming each of the seven AWS Config rules produces a definitive compliance result rather than INSUFFICIENT_DATA or NOT_APPLICABLE. The rules collectively evaluate encryption, network access, authentication, secret management, threat detection, and network logging controls, providing continuous automated assurance that the evaluated controls remain in the expected configuration state.`

    impl_KSI_PIY_GIV `Resource inventory generation is supported by confirming that AWS Config rules are evaluating resources across the account, which requires an active resource inventory maintained by the Config recorder. COMPLIANT results across all seven rules confirm the inventory is complete enough to evaluate the full scope of covered resource types.`

META_END

DEF
    VAR aws_region string `us-east-1`

    OBJECT ebs_encrypted_rule
        rule_name `example-org-ebs-encrypted`
        region VAR aws_region
    OBJECT_END

    OBJECT s3_public_access_rule
        rule_name `example-org-s3-no-public-access`
        region VAR aws_region
    OBJECT_END

    OBJECT cloudtrail_enabled_rule
        rule_name `example-org-cloudtrail-enabled`
        region VAR aws_region
    OBJECT_END

    OBJECT root_mfa_rule
        rule_name `example-org-root-mfa-enabled`
        region VAR aws_region
    OBJECT_END

    OBJECT secrets_rotation_rule
        rule_name `example-org-secrets-rotation`
        region VAR aws_region
    OBJECT_END

    OBJECT guardduty_enabled_rule
        rule_name `example-org-guardduty-enabled`
        region VAR aws_region
    OBJECT_END

    OBJECT vpc_flow_logs_rule
        rule_name `example-org-vpc-flow-logs`
        region VAR aws_region
    OBJECT_END

    # All rules: ACTIVE and COMPLIANT
    STATE rule_compliant
        found boolean = true
        rule_state string = `ACTIVE`
        compliance_type string = `COMPLIANT`
        source_owner string = `AWS`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN aws_config_rule
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF rule_compliant
            OBJECT_REF ebs_encrypted_rule
        CTN_END

        CTN aws_config_rule
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF rule_compliant
            OBJECT_REF s3_public_access_rule
        CTN_END

        CTN aws_config_rule
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF rule_compliant
            OBJECT_REF cloudtrail_enabled_rule
        CTN_END

        CTN aws_config_rule
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF rule_compliant
            OBJECT_REF root_mfa_rule
        CTN_END

        CTN aws_config_rule
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF rule_compliant
            OBJECT_REF secrets_rotation_rule
        CTN_END

        CTN aws_config_rule
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF rule_compliant
            OBJECT_REF guardduty_enabled_rule
        CTN_END

        CTN aws_config_rule
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF rule_compliant
            OBJECT_REF vpc_flow_logs_rule
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
